    <!-- Three stroked centrelines, not a filled glyph: the K is drawn the way a
         terminal draws a rule, not the way a type designer draws a letter.
         Square caps/joins only: VISUAL-LANGUAGE §4 bans pill shapes even here.
         Every terminal sits at r≈32.1 from centre, just inside the 33dp
         adaptive-icon safe zone, so it survives circle/squircle/rounded-square
         masks identically. -->
